Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 21:14:34 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] oblivios: copy the owner's wallpaper files to the decoy
 instead of setStream, which never finished for a user that is not on screen

WallpaperManagerService finishes a static set (crop, metadata, binding) in a file observer that it starts for the current and the unlocked user only, so the decoy kept wallpaper_orig and no crop and showed a black home and lock screen (DUR-038, lynx 2026111401).
